  "description": "Unified Admin UI + IAM + JWT + Basic Auth + API Keys for multi-tenant Dynamic CRUD API platforms. v1.9.0 adds a signed per-database cross-app handoff and a \"🎨 Config Editor\" button on the Databases page for WebSvc.ConfigVisualizer, the new tenant dashboard config JSON editor. v1.8.0 rounds out the Tenant Portal's self-service database registration: fixes the platform-admin \"Test Connection\" button (it called a route that was never mapped), adds a matching tenant-side pre-registration test endpoint, returns a clean 409 on a duplicate database key instead of a raw SQL exception, and adds additive stateless Authorization: Bearer API-key auth to /api/tenant/* for server-to-server callers, alongside the existing cookie login. v1.7.0 opens cross-app handoff links in a new tab, adds a general (non-per-database) SqliteAdmin handoff, lets a Global Admin set/change a database's owning tenant from the Edit modal, and materializes RateLimitAdmin's per-database row immediately on handoff instead of waiting for real traffic. v1.6.0 added a signed cross-app handoff (CrossAppHandoffService) and a plain-string caller-identity bridge so independent add-on packages (e.g. WebSvc.RateLimitAdmin) can offer one-click auto-login and per-request identity without any compiled dependency on this package.",
